<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pengingat Tugas - E-Course LMS</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            border-radius: 5px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #ff9800;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: white;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background-color: #ff9800;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .assignment-info {
            background-color: #fff3e0;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .urgent {
            color: #f44336;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Pengingat Tugas</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Halo {{name}},</p>
            <p>Ini adalah pengingat bahwa Anda memiliki tugas yang akan segera jatuh tempo:</p>
            <div class="assignment-info">
                <h3>{{assignmentTitle}}</h3>
                <p><strong>Kursus:</strong> {{courseName}}</p>
                <p><strong>Tenggat Waktu:</strong> <span class="urgent">{{dueDate}}</span></p>
                <p><strong>Waktu Tersisa:</strong> {{timeRemaining}}</p>
            </div>
            <p>Silakan selesaikan dan kumpulkan tugas Anda sebelum tenggat waktu.</p>
            <a href="{{assignmentUrl}}" class="button">Lihat Tugas</a>
            <p>Terima kasih,<br>Tim E-Course LMS</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; {{year}} E-Course LMS. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>